      "descriptionHtml": "<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Fabric:</strong> Soft cotton sweatshirt knit.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Family story:</strong> One cozy Christmas look for mom, dad, and the kids, made for tree trimming, holiday outings, and family photos.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Print:</strong> Red or green crewneck sweatshirts carry a row of little holiday friends across the chest: gift boxes, Santa, a snowman in a Santa hat, a reindeer, and a Christmas tree, with tiny gold stars.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Design details:</strong> Long-sleeve crewneck sweatshirt with a ribbed neckline, cuffs, and hem.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Care:</strong> Follow the care label sewn into each garment.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Size range:</strong> Child 6-12 Months through Child 11-12 Years, and Adult S through Adult 4XL.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Size Chart - Sweatshirt</h3>\n<table id=\"size-chart\" class=\"size-chart\">\n<thead><tr>\n<th>Size</th>\n<th>Age</th>\n<th>Weight (kg)</th>\n<th>Height (cm)</th>\n<th>Chest/Bust (cm)</th>\n<th>Sleeve (cm)</th>\n<th>Pant/Short (cm)</th>\n<th>Hip (cm)</th>\n<th>Waist (cm)</th>\n<th>Garment Length (cm)</th>\n</tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 6-12 Months</td>\n<td>6-12 mo</td>\n<td>7–11 kg</td>\n<td>70–80 cm</td>\n<td>69 cm</td>\n<td>27 cm</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>35 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 1-2 Years</td>\n<td>1-2</td>\n<td>11–13.5 kg</td>\n<td>80–90 cm</td>\n<td>73 cm</td>\n<td>29 cm</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>38 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 2-3 Years</td>\n<td>2-3</td>\n<td>13.5–16.5 kg</td>\n<td>90–100 cm</td>\n<td>77 cm</td>\n<td>31 cm</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>41 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 4 Years</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>16.5–19 kg</td>\n<td>100–110 cm</td>\n<td>81 cm</td>\n<td>33 cm</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>44 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 5-6 Years</td>\n<td>5-6</td>\n<td>19–22.5 kg</td>\n<td>110–120 cm</td>\n<td>85 cm</td>\n<td>35 cm</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>47 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 7-8 Years</td>\n<td>7-8</td>\n<td>22.5–27.5 kg</td>\n<td>120–130 cm</td>\n<td>89 cm</td>\n<td>37 cm</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>50 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 9-10 Years</td>\n<td>9-10</td>\n<td>27.5–32.5 kg</td>\n<td>130–140 cm</td>\n<td>93 cm</td>\n<td>39 cm</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>53 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 11-12 Years</td>\n<td>11-12</td>\n<td>32.5–37.5 kg</td>\n<td>140–150 cm</td>\n<td>97 cm</td>\n<td>41 cm</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>56 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adult S</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>42.5–55 kg</td>\n<td>150–165 cm</td>\n<td>108 cm</td>\n<td>50.5 cm</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>65 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adult M</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>55–62.5 kg</td>\n<td>155–170 cm</td>\n<td>112 cm</td>\n<td>52 cm</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>68 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adult L</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>62.5–72.5 kg</td>\n<td>160–175 cm</td>\n<td>116 cm</td>\n<td>53.5 cm</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>69 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adult XL</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>72.5–82.5 kg</td>\n<td>165–180 cm</td>\n<td>120 cm</td>\n<td>55 cm</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>71 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adult 2XL</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>82.5–92.5 kg</td>\n<td>170–185 cm</td>\n<td>124 cm</td>\n<td>56.5 cm</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>73 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adult 3XL</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>92.5–105 kg</td>\n<td>175–190 cm</td>\n<td>128 cm</td>\n<td>58 cm</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>75 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adult 4XL</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>105–115 kg</td>\n<td>180–195 cm</td>\n<td>132 cm</td>\n<td>59.5 cm</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>77 cm</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>The whole family can wear the same Christmas sweatshirt, with child and adult sizes. Pick a size for each family member separately to build your matching look.</p>\n\n<p>Each size is one crewneck sweatshirt; the pants in the photos are not included. Chest is the full chest measurement and garment length is the top length. Height and weight are a general fit guide, and child ages are typical for those heights. Measurements are approximate, so compare with a sweatshirt that fits well today.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Whole-family match:</strong> The same Christmas sweatshirt in child and adult sizes.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Holiday friends print:</strong> Santa, a snowman, a reindeer, and a tree lined up with gift boxes across the chest.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft knit:</strong> A soft cotton knit for cozy holiday days.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Photo-ready:</strong> Coordinated colors made for Christmas cards and holiday photos.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Full family size range:</strong> Eight child sizes and seven adult sizes; see the size chart for measurements.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Choose the sizes you need for a cozy family Christmas.</p>",
